       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. V59LENAGREE.
      *> V59 DRIFT GUARD - THE CLASS, NOT THE INSTANCE.
      *> FUNCTION LENGTH RETURNS THE LENGTH IN ALPHANUMERIC CHARACTER
      *> POSITIONS (15.50.4 r3) AND FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH THE LENGTH IN
      *> BYTES (15.14.4 r1). IN A SINGLE-BYTE-CHARACTER MODEL THEY
      *> CANNOT DISAGREE FOR ANY ITEM THAT IS NEITHER NATIONAL (2 BYTES
      *> PER POSITION, 13.18.60.4 GR8) NOR BOOLEAN (WHOSE UNIT IS A
      *> BOOLEAN POSITION, 15.50.4 r1). EVERY LINE HERE MUST BE "OK".
      *> NB 15.14.4 AND 15.50.4 ARE "RETURNED VALUE RULES", NOT GENERAL
      *> RULES - HENCE r<N>, NOT GR<N>. 13.18.60.4 REALLY IS GENERAL.
      *> THIS IS THE TEST THAT MAKES THE V59 DEFECT CLASS IMPOSSIBLE TO
      *> REINTRODUCE: IT COMPARES THE TWO ANSWERS THE COMPILER ACTUALLY
      *> EMITS, ACROSS EVERY FIXED-POINT USAGE AND EVERY WIDTH TIER.
      *> ⛔ IT IS NOT REDUNDANT WITH ImageWidthIsStorageWidthTests, AND
      *> THAT WAS MEASURED, NOT ASSUMED. THAT TEST PINS THE MODEL
      *> (ImageWidth == ByteWidth); THIS ONE PINS THE BINDER FOLD THAT
      *> READS IT. REPOINTING FUNCTION LENGTH AT DataItem.DisplayTextWidth
      *> - THE THIRD WIDTH V59 STEP 4 INTRODUCED, AND THE ONE PLAUSIBLE
      *> FUTURE DRIFT - TURNS THIS GOLDEN RED AT B-2 WHILE ALL 324
      *> MODEL-LEVEL FACTS STAY GREEN. THE MODEL TESTS ARE STRUCTURALLY
      *> BLIND TO WHICH WIDTH THE INTRINSIC ACTUALLY FOLDS TO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 D-1     PIC 9.
       01 D-18    PIC S9(18).
       01 D-SEP   PIC S9(4) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
       01 B-2     PIC 9(2) COMP.
       01 B-4     PIC S9(4) COMP.
       01 B-9     PIC 9(9) COMP.
       01 B-18    PIC S9(18) COMP.
      *> THE 16-BYTE TIER (13.18.60.4 GR4 - STORAGE SUFFICIENT FOR THE
      *> RANGE THE PICTURE IMPLIES; S9(19) EXCEEDS 2**63-1). IT HAS NO
      *> OTHER CORPUS INSTANCE, SO WITHOUT THESE ROWS THE NEWEST WIDTH
      *> TIER IS THE ONE NOTHING WOULD NOTICE DRIFTING.
       01 B-19    PIC S9(19) COMP.
       01 B-31    PIC S9(31) COMP.
       01 P-1     PIC 9(1) COMP-3.
       01 P-4     PIC S9(4) COMP-3.
       01 P-18    PIC S9(18) COMP-3.
       01 P-19    PIC S9(19) COMP-3.
       01 A-7     PIC X(7).
       01 E-6     PIC ZZ,ZZ9.
       01 G-MIX.
          05 G-D   PIC 9(4).
          05 G-B   PIC S9(4) COMP.
          05 G-P   PIC 9(4) COMP-3.
          05 G-A   PIC X(3).
       01 T-OCC.
          05 T-E OCCURS 4 TIMES.
             10 T-B PIC 9(4) COMP.
             10 T-A PIC X(2).
       01 L PIC 9(3).
       01 B PIC 9(3).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN.
           PERFORM CHECK-D-1
           PERFORM CHECK-D-18
           PERFORM CHECK-D-SEP
           PERFORM CHECK-B-2
           PERFORM CHECK-B-4
           PERFORM CHECK-B-9
           PERFORM CHECK-B-18
           PERFORM CHECK-B-19
           PERFORM CHECK-B-31
           PERFORM CHECK-P-1
           PERFORM CHECK-P-4
           PERFORM CHECK-P-18
           PERFORM CHECK-P-19
           PERFORM CHECK-A-7
           PERFORM CHECK-E-6
           PERFORM CHECK-G-MIX
           PERFORM CHECK-T-OCC
           STOP RUN.
       CHECK-D-1.
           MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(D-1) TO L
           MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(D-1) TO B
           PERFORM VERDICT.
       CHECK-D-18.
           MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(D-18) TO L
           MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(D-18) TO B
           PERFORM VERDICT.
       CHECK-D-SEP.
           MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(D-SEP) TO L
           MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(D-SEP) TO B
           PERFORM VERDICT.
       CHECK-B-2.
           MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(B-2) TO L
           MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(B-2) TO B
           PERFORM VERDICT.
       CHECK-B-4.
           MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(B-4) TO L
           MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(B-4) TO B
           PERFORM VERDICT.
       CHECK-B-9.
           MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(B-9) TO L
           MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(B-9) TO B
           PERFORM VERDICT.
       CHECK-B-18.
           MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(B-18) TO L
           MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(B-18) TO B
           PERFORM VERDICT.
       CHECK-B-19.
           MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(B-19) TO L
           MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(B-19) TO B
           PERFORM VERDICT.
       CHECK-B-31.
           MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(B-31) TO L
           MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(B-31) TO B
           PERFORM VERDICT.
       CHECK-P-1.
           MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(P-1) TO L
           MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(P-1) TO B
           PERFORM VERDICT.
       CHECK-P-4.
           MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(P-4) TO L
           MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(P-4) TO B
           PERFORM VERDICT.
       CHECK-P-18.
           MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(P-18) TO L
           MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(P-18) TO B
           PERFORM VERDICT.
       CHECK-P-19.
           MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(P-19) TO L
           MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(P-19) TO B
           PERFORM VERDICT.
       CHECK-A-7.
           MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(A-7) TO L
           MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(A-7) TO B
           PERFORM VERDICT.
       CHECK-E-6.
           MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(E-6) TO L
           MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(E-6) TO B
           PERFORM VERDICT.
       CHECK-G-MIX.
           MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(G-MIX) TO L
           MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(G-MIX) TO B
           PERFORM VERDICT.
       CHECK-T-OCC.
           MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(T-OCC) TO L
           MOVE FUNCTION BYTE-LENGTH(T-OCC) TO B
           PERFORM VERDICT.
       VERDICT.
           IF L = B
               DISPLAY "OK " L
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "BAD L=" L " B=" B
           END-IF.
